{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A man travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> feet due north at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes per mile. He returns due south to his starting point at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles per minute. The average rate in miles per hour for the entire trip is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e394ea6f649a809a8be7696c9d1ae29faa59d6bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 75\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 48\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 45\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 24\\qquad\\\\  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{impossible to determine without knowing the value of }{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"445\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The man's rate initially is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fa3648eb6531dcb20391b0111cc5d353ba61498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1 \\text{mi}}{2 \\text{min}}*\\frac{60 \\text{min}}{1 \\text{hr}}=30 \\text{m/h}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"183\" height=\"38\" />. Velocity final: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c9f70c7e874255fa6c8a3c74abb56494243242f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2 \\text{mi}}{1 \\text{min}}*\\frac{60 \\text{min}}{1 \\text{hr}}=120 \\text{m/h}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"192\" height=\"38\" />. The formula for calculating the average rate over a round trip is: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8e493e88db70b36d6a45f305f9ee95304f54ceb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2v_1 v_2}{v_1 + v_2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"61\" height=\"41\" />. Plugging stuff in gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/a/63a157e9ab7fffd8e395bd3e299dd48ed95b582e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B) 48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"53\" height=\"32\" /> Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> cancels out and does not matter in this situation. Also the answer is almost never weird long answers like option E\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 